{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadioPicker"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"OUDSRadioPicker","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents15OUDSRadioPickerV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadioPicker"}],"role":"symbol","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"macOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"visionOS","beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPicker"},"abstract":[{"text":"A picker allowing to expose several radio buttons and choose only one within the others.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each radio button contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose the choosen value through this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPicker\/init(selection:radios:placement:isOutlined:isReversed:isError:isReadOnly:hasDivider:itemsSpacing:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioPicker\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Imple